id=y700_coloros_round_corners_off
name=Y700 ColorOS Global Round Corners Off
version=1.5
versionCode=6
author=Codex for lorana
description=Optional module that disables Android and ColorOS rounded-corner providers on Lenovo Y700 Gen 4 ColorOS ports. Includes a SystemUI-only recommended Xposed scope and automatic Vector configuration. Requires meta-overlayfs.
